      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Job Agent – Weekly Summary\nEvery Sunday evening (UK): counts the week's new jobs, strong matches, red flags, applications, interviews, runs, failures and AI tokens, and saves one row to the **Weekly Summary** table (created automatically the first time).",
